# h3-sage — the H3 engine with SageAttention instead of the CUDNN default.
# The experiment: same model, same mods, same everything, one backend flag —
# measured against the 596 s warm baseline (5 s / 30 steps / 672x384 / seed
# 42). Benchmark on the SECOND render; the first pays compile warmup.
# Judge frames, not just seconds: INT8 attention is nominally lossy.
. recipes/h3.env
IMAGE=dgx-h3-sage:v0.26.0
SERVE_ARGS+=(--diffusion-attention-backend SAGE_ATTN)
